WEBVTT

01:04.689 --> 01:05.607
ACK

01:05.690 --> 01:07.067
Don't worry.

01:10.445 --> 01:12.947
I've got your back. Okay?

01:16.034 --> 01:16.868
Woo-jin.

01:19.537 --> 01:20.580
Yes?

01:22.457 --> 01:23.792
Your breath stinks!

01:23.875 --> 01:24.793
Gun-woo.

01:24.876 --> 01:28.213
Even if that's true, that's not something
you say in the morning.

01:28.296 --> 01:29.798
Smell it yourself.

01:30.465 --> 01:31.883
Maybe you're sick?

01:32.425 --> 01:34.135
How about the hospital after training?

01:58.701 --> 02:00.495
Seriously. Those boys.

02:07.127 --> 02:08.962
-Run! Ack!
-Ack!

02:09.045 --> 02:09.921
Go!

02:13.299 --> 02:15.343
-Let's take over the world!
-Ack!

02:42.662 --> 02:43.496
Number three!

02:57.886 --> 02:59.095
Enjoy.

02:59.179 --> 03:00.305
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

03:01.514 --> 03:04.392
-Mom, we're here.
-Perfect. Woo-jin, two iced Americanos.

03:05.351 --> 03:07.020
-Be safe, Gun-woo.
-Okay.

03:07.604 --> 03:08.605
Let's do this.

03:09.105 --> 03:10.732
-I'll be back.
-Okay.

03:38.259 --> 03:40.595
MOVING ON FRIDAY, 2/14
THANK YOU FOR YOUR UNDERSTANDING

03:42.597 --> 03:44.307
BUILDING 104
UNIT 1901

03:53.358 --> 03:56.319
-Jeong-gwon, put it over there.
-Okay.

03:57.570 --> 03:59.405
-Hi, it's me.
-Here you go.

04:00.281 --> 04:01.115
Whoa!

04:01.991 --> 04:04.077
You are Kim Gun-woo, right?

04:04.160 --> 04:05.703
-Yes.
-Mind if we shake hands?

04:05.787 --> 04:06.746
Not at all.

04:07.747 --> 04:08.748
Wow, your hands…

04:11.167 --> 04:14.921
Sorry, you had to take the stairs
because I was hogging the elevator.

04:15.004 --> 04:18.383
It's fine. I prefer the stairs anyway.

04:18.466 --> 04:22.887
It hits muscles that boxing doesn't touch,
so it helps with my balance.

04:25.682 --> 04:27.475
Wow, that's amazing.

04:28.101 --> 04:29.852
I'm a tae kwon do athlete too.

04:30.645 --> 04:31.813
Wow.

04:39.404 --> 04:40.321
Well…

04:42.156 --> 04:42.991
Tae…

04:47.370 --> 04:49.706
Sorry, I'm not much of a talker.

04:50.873 --> 04:53.001
I'll be rooting for you in the finals.
Let's go!

04:54.043 --> 04:54.877
Let's go!

04:54.961 --> 04:56.129
Enjoy your coffee.

04:56.629 --> 04:58.006
-Thank you.
-Okay.

05:00.758 --> 05:01.968
Oh wow.

05:03.177 --> 05:04.470
Yo, Jeong-gwon!

05:06.306 --> 05:07.140
Here you go.

05:08.141 --> 05:08.975
All good?

05:12.395 --> 05:14.856
-Thanks for the food!
-Thank you, Mom!

05:19.402 --> 05:21.696
Aren't you cutting weight?

05:22.697 --> 05:23.573
Yup.

05:26.326 --> 05:27.827
Is he going to be okay?

05:27.910 --> 05:30.663
He's fine. Cutting weight is easy for him.

05:31.205 --> 05:33.750
-Gun-woo, you'll make weight, right?
-Yup.

05:38.963 --> 05:40.757
Just do what he says, okay?

05:41.424 --> 05:44.302
-Yup.
-And you, take good care of him.

05:44.969 --> 05:45.803
Yup.

05:46.387 --> 05:47.221
"Yup."

05:48.723 --> 05:49.640
"Yup."

05:51.267 --> 05:56.314
We'll now begin the official weigh-in
for the WBC Super Middleweight Title.

05:56.898 --> 06:00.151
First up, the weigh-in
for the champion, Adik Belov.

06:01.444 --> 06:04.530
Adik Belov has made the weight!

06:07.992 --> 06:11.204
Next up, the weigh-in
for the challenger, Kim Gun-woo.

06:16.918 --> 06:19.420
Kim Gun-woo has made the weight!

06:19.504 --> 06:20.671
Nice!

06:23.716 --> 06:28.721
Next up, the two fighters will face off
ahead of tomorrow's exciting fight.

06:28.805 --> 06:32.558
Fighters, please come forward
to the center of the stage.

06:52.578 --> 06:53.746
Well…

06:53.830 --> 06:56.833
Staff, the fighters are getting
a bit too heated.

06:56.916 --> 06:59.252
-Step in and separate them.
-Get off!

06:59.752 --> 07:02.463
-Get off me! Hey!
-Take it easy.

08:20.833 --> 08:23.336
BLOODHOUNDS 2

08:24.504 --> 08:26.964
Hello, I'm Hong Seok-hyeon,
your lead commentator.

08:27.048 --> 08:30.426
Joining me is Kim Kwang-sun,
the '88 Olympic gold medalist and analyst.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.220
-Hello.
-Yes, hello.

08:32.303 --> 08:35.640
We're moments away from
the WBC super middleweight title fight

08:35.723 --> 08:37.850
between Adik Belov and Kim Gun-woo.

08:37.934 --> 08:41.687
Five years ago, during COVID,
Kim Gun-woo won Rookie of the Year.

08:41.771 --> 08:45.525
-Since then, his career has taken off.
-You got this!

08:45.608 --> 08:48.778
-He now challenges for the world title.
-I was on the call back then.

08:48.861 --> 08:50.404
I'm proud he made it here.

08:50.488 --> 08:53.533
And as we speak,
both fighters are in the ring.

08:53.616 --> 08:55.910
Kim Gun-woo offered a glove touch,

08:55.993 --> 08:58.079
but Adik Belov refused.

08:58.162 --> 09:01.707
That's right.
It shows he's a master of mind games.

09:01.791 --> 09:04.752
-What kind of fight will we see here?
-Box!

09:04.835 --> 09:06.003
Round one begins.

09:06.087 --> 09:11.050
Once again, Adik Belov gives
a forceful shove to Kim Gun-woo's gloves.

09:11.133 --> 09:12.802
Indeed he did.

09:12.885 --> 09:16.597
Belov is applying
constant, aggressive pressure.

09:16.681 --> 09:20.685
Belov dominates early
with his signature heavy combinations.

09:20.768 --> 09:22.853
Yes, no feeling-out process here.

09:22.937 --> 09:26.983
Belov backed him into the corner.
Kim guards high, stepping forward.

09:27.066 --> 09:28.859
The combo lands! Huge left!

09:38.202 --> 09:40.997
Kim Gun-woo pressed forward.

09:41.080 --> 09:44.041
-But Belov caught him with a counter.
-Gun-woo!

09:44.125 --> 09:45.126
Keep breathing!

09:45.710 --> 09:46.752
That's it!

09:52.800 --> 09:54.051
What happens if he wins?

09:54.135 --> 09:56.929
That purse covers his debt to you.

09:57.013 --> 09:59.890
Why the fuck did I come to Korea?

09:59.974 --> 10:01.392
I'll get him no matter what.

10:02.226 --> 10:04.437
Get him in the cage. Period.

10:05.771 --> 10:06.772
Yes, sir.

10:10.484 --> 10:12.028
You can do it, son!

10:14.905 --> 10:16.073
He's okay. He will be.

10:18.743 --> 10:22.079
-Box!
-Kim Gun-woo went down once.

10:22.163 --> 10:25.041
He really needs to watch out
for the counter.

10:25.124 --> 10:28.044
-Kim is also an inside fighter by trade.
-Indeed.

10:28.127 --> 10:33.007
But Belov's aggression
is forcing him back.

10:33.090 --> 10:36.302
Now, how can Kim break this momentum?

10:36.385 --> 10:37.887
Another hard body shot!

10:37.970 --> 10:40.389
Belov's backing Kim into the corner!

10:40.473 --> 10:43.517
Belov's been on him since round one.

10:43.601 --> 10:45.936
Smart clinching there.

10:46.020 --> 10:49.482
Kim Gun-woo is cleverly slowing the pace.

10:49.565 --> 10:53.027
Kim Gun-woo is also a pressure fighter,
but he's retreating now.

10:53.110 --> 10:55.529
Kim Gun-woo steps off the tracks for now.

10:55.613 --> 10:58.616
The toll of the first round is clear.

10:58.699 --> 11:01.869
Adik Belov's looking to trap him
in the corner.

11:01.952 --> 11:04.205
Belov is cornering him again.

11:04.705 --> 11:05.956
Huge right hand!

11:06.040 --> 11:08.250
-Belov unloads the straight rights!
-Yes.

11:08.334 --> 11:09.877
He's pouring it on!

11:09.960 --> 11:13.130
Another smart clinch. Kim is hanging on.

11:13.214 --> 11:15.383
-The first round…
-Time!

11:15.466 --> 11:17.176
-Round one is over.
-Yes.

11:17.259 --> 11:19.720
That's a wrap on round one.

11:22.473 --> 11:24.767
He's too strong on the inside.

11:24.850 --> 11:26.560
Okay, catch your breath.

11:27.061 --> 11:28.104
Gun-woo.

11:28.729 --> 11:30.064
Stop backing up.

11:30.147 --> 11:34.360
Get in there and take it to him.
You're unbeatable.

11:36.987 --> 11:37.905
Look at me.

11:43.327 --> 11:44.161
Kim Gun-woo.

11:47.748 --> 11:50.334
Trust the inside drills we worked on.

11:53.337 --> 11:54.630
Believe in us.

11:59.635 --> 12:02.304
Get set for number three.
Wait for my call.

12:03.055 --> 12:04.265
-Ack!
-Ack!

12:04.348 --> 12:05.391
Ack!

12:13.441 --> 12:15.443
Round two is underway.

12:15.526 --> 12:19.196
Expect a more focused Kim Gun-woo
in the second round.

12:19.280 --> 12:22.867
-Exactly. He got crushed in the first.
-He certainly did.

12:23.367 --> 12:27.747
Kim Gun-woo opens the round
with a flurry in the center of the ring!

12:27.830 --> 12:29.623
-There's the counter!
-Indeed.

12:29.707 --> 12:31.250
-Look!
-Perfect counter!

12:31.333 --> 12:34.253
Kim Gun-woo is coming out
very aggressively.

12:34.754 --> 12:38.549
In the second round,
Kim Gun-woo is bringing the heat inside.

12:38.632 --> 12:44.638
His corner clearly lit a fire under him
after that first round.

12:44.722 --> 12:47.433
Kim is bobbing and weaving
to close the distance.

12:47.516 --> 12:49.018
He's throwing in bunches!

12:49.101 --> 12:51.771
Yes, he's showing great combination work.

12:51.854 --> 12:54.732
-Pins him in the corner! Big body shot!
-Great head movement!

12:54.815 --> 12:56.066
-He's taking over!
-Three!

12:57.026 --> 13:00.905
Body shot, then a barrage!
Kim Gun-woo is pouring it on!

13:00.988 --> 13:03.282
What a great flurry!

13:04.492 --> 13:06.869
Kim Gun-woo cracks him with a straight!

13:07.369 --> 13:09.163
That was a massive shot.

13:10.247 --> 13:12.583
He stopped!

13:12.666 --> 13:15.044
That could've been the finishing blow.

13:15.127 --> 13:16.670
-It sure was.
-He stopped.

13:16.754 --> 13:20.049
That straight right
landed flush on the eye.

13:20.132 --> 13:20.966
The second punch…

13:21.759 --> 13:24.094
-He held fire right at the bell.
-Exactly.

13:24.178 --> 13:25.971
That's great sportsmanship.

13:26.055 --> 13:27.181
Real class.

13:27.264 --> 13:28.849
In the second round,

13:28.933 --> 13:33.604
Kim Gun-woo showed his fans
world-class skill and class.

13:33.687 --> 13:37.399
In the second round,
he showed great momentum and movement.

13:37.483 --> 13:42.112
I can't wait to see
what he's got in store for the third.

13:43.030 --> 13:44.240
-Gun-woo.
-Yeah?

13:45.115 --> 13:46.367
His left eye is a mess.

13:46.450 --> 13:49.328
Finish him with the right. Put him away!

13:52.748 --> 13:53.874
-Woo-jin.
-Yeah?

13:54.708 --> 13:56.377
How about number one instead?

13:56.460 --> 13:58.379
Now? But we're so close.

14:01.757 --> 14:03.509
If I hit him with my right again,

14:04.009 --> 14:06.136
he'll need dozens of stitches.

14:06.220 --> 14:08.430
No, Gun-woo. He's the champion.

14:08.514 --> 14:11.600
He's unpredictable.
Finish him while you have the chance!

14:12.810 --> 14:14.395
Trust Bloodhound Number One.

14:15.062 --> 14:16.981
It's our first-ever combination.

14:28.492 --> 14:29.326
All right.

14:31.203 --> 14:34.206
Then you've gotta hit him damn fast.

14:34.707 --> 14:36.250
Fast, got it.

14:36.876 --> 14:38.460
Damn fast!

14:38.544 --> 14:39.837
Fast!

14:40.462 --> 14:41.755
-Ack!
-Ack!

14:42.756 --> 14:44.174
-Ack!
-Ack!

14:44.258 --> 14:45.301
-Go!
-Ack!

15:02.943 --> 15:04.486
Round three is underway.

15:05.696 --> 15:09.450
Guard high, stepping forward
to start the third.

15:10.743 --> 15:14.288
The left body shot lands clean!

15:14.914 --> 15:17.166
That lands clean. A left to the body.

15:17.249 --> 15:18.709
It landed flush!

15:18.792 --> 15:21.378
Adik Belov is down!

15:21.462 --> 15:23.964
Adik just ate a massive shot!

15:24.048 --> 15:27.134
Adik Belov took heavy damage.

15:27.217 --> 15:28.677
He can't get up!

15:28.761 --> 15:29.929
Adik Belov.

15:31.013 --> 15:32.056
And it's nine!

15:32.139 --> 15:34.058
The fight is over!

15:34.141 --> 15:35.476
It's a KO!

15:35.559 --> 15:38.145
-That's it!
-It's a walk-off KO!

15:38.228 --> 15:41.523
Kim Gun-woo wins the fight!

15:41.607 --> 15:46.445
Kim Gun-woo!

15:46.528 --> 15:49.073
Kim Gun-woo!

15:51.825 --> 15:53.577
Kim Gun-woo!

16:26.360 --> 16:28.445
Gun-woo, look at this.

16:34.868 --> 16:36.787
Damn, why do people smoke this?

16:36.870 --> 16:37.871
Throw it away.

16:38.455 --> 16:39.456
It's 100,000 won.

16:40.374 --> 16:41.208
What?

16:41.291 --> 16:42.209
I'm tossing it.

16:42.292 --> 16:43.711
Tossing it.

16:44.712 --> 16:45.546
Gun-woo.

16:46.255 --> 16:47.131
Still, it's nice.

16:47.715 --> 16:49.133
You just blew 100,000 won.

16:50.050 --> 16:52.845
Hey, remember when we were so broke

16:52.928 --> 16:55.097
we could barely afford
a 30,000-won buffet?

16:55.597 --> 16:57.599
But now we can smoke a premium cigar.

16:58.434 --> 17:00.728
And we won the championship!

17:01.895 --> 17:02.938
True.

17:08.152 --> 17:12.114
Feels like only yesterday
we took down Kim Myeong-gil. Time flies.

17:18.579 --> 17:19.413
What is it?

17:20.914 --> 17:21.749
Woo-jin.

17:22.541 --> 17:25.711
Should we take the title belt
and visit Mr. Choi's grave?

17:28.338 --> 17:30.424
Sometimes, you seem more mature than me.

17:31.300 --> 17:33.010
-Tell me about it.
-What?

17:33.594 --> 17:34.678
Just kidding.

17:35.971 --> 17:38.682
Cracking jokes? Look at you, all grown up.

17:38.766 --> 17:40.309
I learned from the best.

17:43.395 --> 17:45.355
You know, I'm grateful for you.

17:45.856 --> 17:46.774
Huh?

17:46.857 --> 17:51.570
Remember when we tried to borrow money
from Im, the loan shark?

17:52.946 --> 17:56.116
He said he'd only lend us 100 million
if I became his bloodhound.

17:56.700 --> 17:59.453
I'll give you a 1% interest loan
of 100 million for one year.

17:59.536 --> 18:01.914
Work as a bloodhound with me for a year.

18:04.500 --> 18:07.878
If you hadn't pulled me out back then…

18:10.422 --> 18:13.258
I'd probably still be beating people up
for money.

18:14.635 --> 18:15.803
Thanks to you, Gun-woo,

18:17.346 --> 18:19.139
I'm wearing this belt.

18:20.057 --> 18:20.974
No, Woo-jin.

18:22.267 --> 18:23.685
I'm only here

18:24.228 --> 18:25.813
because of you.

18:27.231 --> 18:31.235
And because of you,
we were able to beat Kim Myeong-gil.

18:31.860 --> 18:32.945
Besides,

18:33.695 --> 18:37.199
I never would have made it this far
with Coach Kim.

18:39.409 --> 18:44.456
It's all because of you
that we are world champions.

18:45.457 --> 18:48.210
Retiring from boxing
and becoming your coach

18:50.129 --> 18:54.424
was the best move
I've ever made in my life.

18:55.968 --> 18:58.345
Let's not stop at the world championship.

18:59.221 --> 19:01.056
Let's conquer the universe.

19:03.642 --> 19:04.935
Until the day we die,

19:05.769 --> 19:07.312
let's shout "Ack" together!

19:10.357 --> 19:11.191
Ack.

19:11.275 --> 19:12.276
Ack.

19:12.359 --> 19:13.485
Ack.

19:15.320 --> 19:16.321
Flip them over.

19:16.405 --> 19:18.615
No, give it another 30 seconds.

19:18.699 --> 19:20.868
-Come on, just do it.
-No.

19:20.951 --> 19:23.412
Just give it a try.

19:25.122 --> 19:25.956
Huh?

19:26.832 --> 19:27.833
What happened?

19:27.916 --> 19:30.544
Ta-da. I added more charcoal.

19:32.629 --> 19:34.548
When did you do that?

19:51.440 --> 19:52.816
-Sure.
-I'm good.

20:00.365 --> 20:01.867
-Two blues.
-Yes, sir.

20:06.538 --> 20:08.165
-Throw in some pork neck too.
-Yup.

20:11.627 --> 20:13.545
-Welcome!
-Hello, Ms. Yoon.

20:13.629 --> 20:15.505
-Welcome.
-Hello.

20:15.589 --> 20:17.674
So sorry to bother you again.

20:17.758 --> 20:20.093
No trouble at all. Come on in.

20:20.802 --> 20:26.225
Ms. Yoon, I was in Taiwan for business
and thought of you, so I got you this.

20:26.308 --> 20:28.393
Oh my. You shouldn't have.

20:28.894 --> 20:31.313
Goodness, thank you.

20:31.396 --> 20:34.233
-It's nothing big. I hope you like it.
-Honestly…

20:34.316 --> 20:36.360
You always cook something great for me.

20:36.443 --> 20:39.821
You're always welcome here. Come on in.

20:39.905 --> 20:40.864
Thank you.

20:43.367 --> 20:44.201
-Boys.
-Yeah?

20:44.284 --> 20:45.953
-Min-beom's here.
-Wow!

20:47.621 --> 20:48.622
Min-beom!

20:50.207 --> 20:51.041
Min-beom!

20:51.541 --> 20:53.418
-Oh, is this it?
-Yeah.

20:53.919 --> 20:56.880
I really wanted to be there,
but my trip ran long. I'm sorry.

20:56.964 --> 20:57.965
No worries at all.

20:58.048 --> 20:59.758
He crushed him in the third round.

20:59.841 --> 21:02.219
-So it ended quickly.
-Really?

21:03.470 --> 21:05.931
I've got good news too.
Shall we toast to it?

21:06.014 --> 21:07.140
-Sure.
-Yes.

21:08.767 --> 21:10.102
-Congratulations!
-Cheers!

21:14.147 --> 21:15.732
Hey, was that a one-shot?

21:20.279 --> 21:21.613
Great work, everyone!

21:34.584 --> 21:35.711
Cheers!

21:40.757 --> 21:42.009
Say "ah."

21:47.556 --> 21:49.224
IIL SEOUL HOSPITAL
AERIAL RENDERING

21:50.183 --> 21:51.143
Whoa.

21:51.643 --> 21:53.312
The land is 5,000 pyeong.

21:53.395 --> 21:56.481
It'll be four floors underground
and ten aboveground.

21:56.565 --> 22:01.403
Once the foundation grows,
I'll build a pediatric hospital here.

22:01.486 --> 22:05.157
And we'll name the hospital
after Mr. Choi.

22:05.657 --> 22:08.368
Tae-ho Pediatric Center.

22:11.455 --> 22:13.498
That's amazing.

22:14.583 --> 22:15.625
I know.

22:20.881 --> 22:21.715
Min-beom.

22:22.632 --> 22:23.675
Gun-woo.

22:24.468 --> 22:27.763
For those who are in heaven,

22:28.263 --> 22:29.514
shall we raise our glasses?

22:29.598 --> 22:30.891
Then we should say

22:31.808 --> 22:32.893
thank you.

22:34.144 --> 22:35.437
Now.

22:37.230 --> 22:39.483
-Thank you!
-Thank you!

22:46.239 --> 22:47.699
Thank you.

23:35.914 --> 23:36.748
Take him away.

23:42.129 --> 23:42.963
Fighter on site.

25:17.599 --> 25:18.433
Whoa.

25:26.149 --> 25:26.983
You two, move.

25:53.593 --> 25:54.970
We passed 300 million dollars.

25:55.554 --> 25:58.682
We're hitting 400 million dollars.
Our cut is 12 million.

25:59.432 --> 26:00.600
What's my cut?

26:01.184 --> 26:02.435
It beats doing nothing.

26:03.562 --> 26:06.189
So how much is that, you fucker?

26:08.775 --> 26:11.069
At least 2.5 times your last take.

26:58.700 --> 27:00.118
Let's get started.

28:25.370 --> 28:26.204
Kill the camera.

28:28.832 --> 28:29.916
Turn off the camera.

28:39.634 --> 28:41.845
You fucking bastard!

29:02.031 --> 29:03.074
How much?

29:03.658 --> 29:05.034
Twelve times the last fight.

29:19.215 --> 29:20.717
Bring me the guy who beat him.

29:21.426 --> 29:22.427
Yes, sir.

29:28.975 --> 29:30.518
Anything worth using?

29:33.980 --> 29:37.358
He still has a pulse,
so I can work with him.

29:37.442 --> 29:38.777
How is his heart?

29:39.277 --> 29:42.572
His heartbeat sounds good.
Perks of being a pro athlete, I guess.

29:42.655 --> 29:43.490
And the price?

29:43.573 --> 29:46.451
50 million won for the heart.
100 million for the kidneys!

29:48.119 --> 29:48.953
Decent price.

29:49.496 --> 29:50.497
Move!

29:57.796 --> 30:01.132
How can I sell the organs if you kill him?

30:06.429 --> 30:08.848
Stuff like this leaves evidence.

30:09.557 --> 30:10.892
Let's not do that.

30:13.478 --> 30:15.855
He wants Gun-woo brought in.

30:27.033 --> 30:29.285
-Try lifting your arm.
-Okay.

30:29.369 --> 30:31.663
-Two, three.
-Let's stand up.

30:32.664 --> 30:34.541
Have you been exercising?

30:34.624 --> 30:35.500
Yes.

30:36.000 --> 30:40.255
Good. Now, try to complete
the movement without my help.

30:40.338 --> 30:42.465
Let's get those fingers fully extended.

30:42.549 --> 30:44.175
Straighten them a bit more.

30:44.259 --> 30:46.302
Good, push through that stretch.

30:46.386 --> 30:48.513
You're doing great. Just a bit more.

30:49.013 --> 30:50.098
Reach for me.

30:50.598 --> 30:51.558
Good.

30:52.308 --> 30:54.602
-Did we pack the kimchi?
-Yup, we did.

30:54.686 --> 30:56.437
Yup. Okay, well…

30:56.521 --> 30:59.566
Extend your fingers all the way.

30:59.649 --> 31:01.901
Yes, that's it. You're doing great.

31:01.985 --> 31:03.278
Just a bit more.

31:03.862 --> 31:05.113
Reach for more.

31:09.117 --> 31:11.786
Now let's try it with one pinky at a time.

31:14.956 --> 31:18.418
Straighten them all the way out.

31:18.501 --> 31:19.627
All the way.

31:20.712 --> 31:21.671
Get home safe.

31:21.754 --> 31:23.298
-Here she comes.
-Thank you.

31:25.675 --> 31:28.595
-Congratulations. You're the champion.
-Thank you.

31:28.678 --> 31:31.014
This week's side dish is jangjorim.

31:31.097 --> 31:32.640
Gun-woo's mom packed a ton of food.

31:33.892 --> 31:36.561
I've already finished the last batch.
Thank you.

31:37.061 --> 31:38.187
Well, then.

31:38.688 --> 31:40.565
Shall we head to the supermarket?

31:40.648 --> 31:41.566
Sure.

31:44.319 --> 31:45.486
Get the elevator.

31:45.570 --> 31:46.571
Sorry about that.

31:47.071 --> 31:49.824
President Hong has wanted me
on board for some time.

31:49.908 --> 31:53.703
My hands still aren't as quick as before,
but I can work.

31:54.495 --> 31:57.123
He's offering me a space
on the ninth floor at Iil Group.

31:57.206 --> 31:58.207
I start next month.

31:58.291 --> 31:59.375
-Great!
-Great!

31:59.876 --> 32:02.170
Is it similar to what you did
with the police?

32:02.253 --> 32:06.758
At the Cyber Investigation Division,
I focused on tracking cybercrime.

32:06.841 --> 32:11.971
But over there, I'll be protecting
Iil Group's network from crackers.

32:12.055 --> 32:13.932
Cracker, wow.

32:14.849 --> 32:15.892
What's a cracker?

32:15.975 --> 32:17.018
You know, this.

32:17.560 --> 32:18.519
It's bad stuff.

32:20.355 --> 32:22.106
They are malicious hackers.

32:22.607 --> 32:23.983
-Yes, that.
-Right.

32:25.443 --> 32:27.904
We passed the toilet paper aisle.

32:28.404 --> 32:29.948
I'll go get it.

32:30.031 --> 32:31.532
-Okay.
-Yup.

32:33.159 --> 32:36.829
Woo-jin, can I say something?

32:36.913 --> 32:37.747
Of course.

32:40.291 --> 32:41.292
Please.

32:42.168 --> 32:46.339
I really appreciate
you guys helping me every week.

32:47.131 --> 32:48.091
But…

32:50.218 --> 32:54.847
you don't have to carry
that guilt around anymore.

32:54.931 --> 32:58.101
I got hurt in the line of duty.

32:58.184 --> 32:59.978
It wasn't your fault or Gun-woo's.

33:01.187 --> 33:03.398
I can manage on my own now.

33:07.151 --> 33:08.194
Tae-yeong.

33:08.778 --> 33:10.822
I've never told you this before.

33:11.531 --> 33:14.283
Gun-woo and I have a rule.

33:15.660 --> 33:16.869
And what's that?

33:18.121 --> 33:21.082
Once family, always family.

33:22.625 --> 33:23.459
And

33:24.502 --> 33:27.547
we protect our family with our lives
till the end.

33:32.260 --> 33:33.261
Tae-yeong.

33:33.970 --> 33:35.388
You are

33:36.514 --> 33:37.807
our family.

33:49.652 --> 33:50.737
Excuse me.

33:52.405 --> 33:53.990
So please

33:55.742 --> 33:57.410
call us anytime.

33:58.661 --> 34:00.079
We're the Marine Duo.

34:00.621 --> 34:02.206
Leave everything to us.

34:03.833 --> 34:06.169
-Tae-yeong.
-Yes?

34:06.919 --> 34:07.754
Ack.

34:19.891 --> 34:20.975
There, there.

34:32.653 --> 34:33.988
So they are dating.

35:11.609 --> 35:12.652
Who is it?

35:12.735 --> 35:14.529
Hello. We're here to see Gun-woo.

35:14.612 --> 35:18.616
Oh, but Gun-woo is not in at the moment.

35:19.283 --> 35:22.411
We were supposed to meet today,
but I guess we're a bit early.

35:22.912 --> 35:25.331
Would you mind if we waited inside?

35:26.791 --> 35:28.960
We're friends who train with Gun-woo.

35:29.043 --> 35:29.961
I see.

35:30.545 --> 35:33.506
We sat behind you at the fight.

35:33.589 --> 35:35.133
We didn't get to say hello.

35:36.342 --> 35:38.594
Could we wait inside?

35:41.514 --> 35:43.975
Sure. You can come in for a bit.

36:26.142 --> 36:27.018
You are back.

36:29.228 --> 36:30.855
-Mom, go upstairs.
-Why?

36:30.938 --> 36:32.064
-Please, now.
-Okay.

36:40.489 --> 36:42.950
Lose the attitude. Sit down.

36:45.369 --> 36:46.787
Sit.

36:48.080 --> 36:49.749
Please sit so we can talk.

36:50.249 --> 36:51.083
Who are you?

36:51.167 --> 36:54.212
I run a boxing league called the IKFC.

36:54.712 --> 36:55.880
You.

36:56.589 --> 36:57.757
Fight in my league.

37:00.968 --> 37:02.345
We've never heard of it.

37:02.428 --> 37:04.931
Of course you haven't.
It's a secret league.

37:05.014 --> 37:08.142
We've got four million members worldwide.

37:09.060 --> 37:11.437
You'd be a huge asset to my league.

37:12.021 --> 37:13.564
What selfish bullshit.

37:14.232 --> 37:15.149
IKFC?

37:15.858 --> 37:18.152
Is that a chicken shack?
We don't need you.

37:25.576 --> 37:28.579
How much did you get for beating Adik?
100 million won?

37:28.663 --> 37:29.497
200 million?

37:32.541 --> 37:36.295
Fight just one fight in the IKFC.
I'll give you ten billion.

37:41.092 --> 37:42.510
A one-billion signing bonus.

37:50.559 --> 37:51.435
Gun-woo.

37:52.061 --> 37:54.772
If you're injured boxing,
you're crippled for life.

37:55.856 --> 37:57.733
So many guys got fucked over.

37:58.734 --> 38:01.028
Make your money while you still can.

38:03.114 --> 38:04.532
Just one game.

38:04.615 --> 38:07.493
Just one game, and you're set for life.

38:11.998 --> 38:14.083
Fuck, with ten billion won,

38:14.917 --> 38:16.752
you'll never have to work again.

38:17.253 --> 38:18.587
Give your mom a good life.

38:24.135 --> 38:25.261
Just one game.

38:30.099 --> 38:31.934
For fuck's sake…

38:34.020 --> 38:34.937
Hey.

38:36.063 --> 38:38.649
If you win,
I'll throw in another five billion.

38:42.903 --> 38:44.280
Fifteen billion won?

38:47.491 --> 38:48.326
Mom.

38:51.329 --> 38:53.039
I don't need that money.

38:54.707 --> 38:57.918
I let them in
because they said they were your friends.

38:58.002 --> 39:01.339
They lied. Their money can't be clean.

39:02.048 --> 39:04.508
Dirty money always comes with a price.

39:13.601 --> 39:15.144
Please leave.

39:15.728 --> 39:16.604
Hey, lady.

39:17.396 --> 39:18.647
Shut your damn mouth.

39:18.731 --> 39:21.275
Fuck your money. Take it and get lost!

39:21.359 --> 39:22.526
Sir.

39:24.362 --> 39:26.405
You came here for a reason.

39:30.868 --> 39:31.911
Let us leave.

39:31.994 --> 39:32.870
Yeah, get lost!

39:33.829 --> 39:34.663
Shut your mouth.

39:37.124 --> 39:39.668
Shut up and stay put, understood?

39:56.936 --> 39:59.313
I always get what I want.

40:02.566 --> 40:04.568
We will fight, I promise.

40:08.489 --> 40:09.490
See you around.

40:20.042 --> 40:21.752
It's okay, Mom.

40:33.722 --> 40:35.474
Get me that prick's mother.

40:41.272 --> 40:42.773
Thank you for the payment.

40:45.443 --> 40:48.946
They'll be back for sure.
We should get ready.

40:49.447 --> 40:51.907
Let's gear up and finish them
when they return.

40:55.578 --> 40:56.412
Woo-jin.

40:57.204 --> 40:59.081
Do you still talk to Yang Jae-myeong?

41:01.167 --> 41:02.668
I'm sure he was a pro.

41:02.751 --> 41:05.004
-Let's ask Yang Jae-myeong.
-Okay.

41:09.800 --> 41:11.343
DIRT-DIGGER YANG

41:18.142 --> 41:20.144
Long time no see! How have you been?

41:22.062 --> 41:23.272
It's been a while.

41:23.898 --> 41:25.441
So, you wanted the dirt?

41:25.524 --> 41:28.235
Consider it dug. I rattled them all loose.

41:44.126 --> 41:46.253
-What? You don't see it on there?
-No.

41:47.338 --> 41:50.257
Of all the pros registered in the KBA,

41:50.341 --> 41:53.260
only these guys fit your description.

41:53.344 --> 41:55.387
How about one weight class lower?

41:55.471 --> 41:57.014
He could've gained weight.

41:57.598 --> 41:59.433
You're absolutely right.

41:59.934 --> 42:02.228
Okay, I'll look into it in no time.

42:02.311 --> 42:06.190
Also, would you have anything on the IKFC?

42:06.273 --> 42:10.152
In fact, I called up all my contacts
in the illegal betting rings.

42:10.236 --> 42:11.987
But no one knows.

42:12.071 --> 42:14.114
Considering the name and all,

42:14.198 --> 42:16.492
they said it might be based abroad.

42:16.575 --> 42:19.495
Yes, they have
four million members worldwide.

42:19.578 --> 42:21.622
Wow, four million?

42:22.790 --> 42:25.543
With four million,
the stakes must be massive.

42:25.626 --> 42:27.419
Please tell us more.

42:27.503 --> 42:30.130
Well, think about it. It's four million.

42:30.214 --> 42:32.258
If each bets 10,000 won, how much?

42:32.341 --> 42:34.510
It's 40 billion.

42:34.593 --> 42:36.804
The fees must be huge too.

42:38.973 --> 42:39.848
Thank you.

42:45.104 --> 42:46.438
-Gun-woo.
-Yeah?

42:46.939 --> 42:50.859
We might have to ask the guys for help.

42:51.527 --> 42:52.403
Which guys?

42:53.153 --> 42:56.782
Everyone. Min-beom,
Gang-yong, and Mr. Moon.

43:00.286 --> 43:03.038
I don't want anyone to get hurt
because of me.

43:05.583 --> 43:07.543
Every time I see Tae-yeong,

43:08.043 --> 43:09.211
it kills me.

43:09.295 --> 43:11.714
This time, let's handle this ourselves.

43:11.797 --> 43:14.008
We took down Kim Myeong-gil.

43:14.091 --> 43:17.970
I think we were only able to do that
because the guys helped us.

43:19.096 --> 43:21.432
Yes, you're right.

43:22.308 --> 43:23.350
Still,

43:24.893 --> 43:27.187
can we give it a shot on our own?

43:31.275 --> 43:32.109
Please?

43:41.785 --> 43:44.788
Let me brief you
on snatching Kim Gun-woo's mother.

43:49.126 --> 43:52.254
All four of them
are serving life in prison.

43:52.338 --> 43:56.592
They've got a serious grudge
against Kim Gun-woo and Hong Woo-jin.

43:56.675 --> 43:58.594
If we can get them out of prison,

43:59.178 --> 44:02.014
they'll become bloodhounds
no one can stop.

44:02.097 --> 44:03.557
What if they go rogue?

44:05.184 --> 44:06.518
I understand your concern.

44:06.602 --> 44:09.104
But once they're out,
they'll be wanted men.

44:09.188 --> 44:11.273
They'll have no choice but to rely on us.

44:11.357 --> 44:13.108
And if they make good on our deal,

44:14.193 --> 44:17.446
I'll help them flee abroad.
That's the carrot I'm dangling.

44:17.529 --> 44:18.906
So how much?

44:19.990 --> 44:22.284
It'll cost 100 million won per head.

44:26.664 --> 44:28.707
Well, that's fucking expensive.

44:28.791 --> 44:31.710
But you'll make over ten times the profit.

44:31.794 --> 44:33.504
Bullshit.

44:52.272 --> 44:53.148
This one.

44:54.733 --> 44:56.318
An excellent choice.

44:57.361 --> 45:01.031
And I have a go-to security firm I use
for VIPs from abroad.

45:01.115 --> 45:04.827
Former presidential bodyguards run it,
so they know their stuff.

45:05.411 --> 45:08.455
But the CEO and the sales director
fell out not long ago,

45:08.539 --> 45:12.668
and they've been behind on payroll
for months.

45:14.002 --> 45:14.878
And?

45:14.962 --> 45:17.923
Thugs and ex-cons tend to be aggressive,

45:18.006 --> 45:21.218
so there's always a risk
of someone getting hurt.

45:21.719 --> 45:24.012
If Kim Gun-woo's mother gets hurt,

45:24.096 --> 45:26.807
things could get ugly real fast.

45:26.890 --> 45:31.520
So I'd recommend going this route,
even if it costs more upfront.

45:34.773 --> 45:37.693
Are you trying to fucking fleece me?
Pick a lane.

45:40.279 --> 45:43.782
In this line of work,
there are too many variables.

45:44.366 --> 45:48.746
You want a bloodhound by your side,
just in case.

45:49.246 --> 45:51.457
That's my golden rule.

46:01.675 --> 46:02.843
Get it right.

46:04.845 --> 46:06.388
Thank you for your payment.

46:14.521 --> 46:15.814
Please get me these.

46:17.608 --> 46:20.444
GASOLINE, DDNP, SALTPETER
NICHROME, DETONATOR, CELL PHONE

46:23.530 --> 46:26.325
I don't think you need to go
this far, Sergeant Yun.

46:26.408 --> 46:28.869
I need to be prepared, Mr. Lee.

46:31.121 --> 46:32.247
You can

46:33.040 --> 46:34.249
trust me.

46:34.333 --> 46:35.918
This is just basic due diligence.

46:56.605 --> 46:57.439
TAO TE CHING

47:00.859 --> 47:03.695
SWALLOW THIS AT 1 P.M. TWO DAYS FROM NOW
I'LL GET YOU OUT

47:52.452 --> 47:55.747
That makes eight, including this one.
That should do it.

47:55.831 --> 47:57.499
-Thank you, sir.
-Gun-woo!

47:57.583 --> 47:59.167
-Gun-woo!
-Yeah?

48:01.295 --> 48:03.130
Adik's team is flying out today,

48:03.839 --> 48:06.425
but he disappeared. He's missing.

48:08.135 --> 48:10.554
UZBEK BOXER MISSING AFTER TITLE FIGHT
PROBE UNDERWAY

48:12.973 --> 48:14.224
Something feels wrong.

48:14.808 --> 48:17.728
I think those bastards are behind this.

49:04.441 --> 49:05.943
This feels wrong, sir.

49:07.653 --> 49:08.654
I mean…

49:09.529 --> 49:11.490
Do we really have to stoop this low?

49:12.783 --> 49:14.242
We're supposed to be bodyguards.

49:14.326 --> 49:16.411
A little late for that, don't you think?

49:17.663 --> 49:19.122
You said you were in.

49:20.540 --> 49:23.168
At this rate, we'll all go under.

49:23.669 --> 49:25.837
We should make payroll for our guys.

49:26.421 --> 49:28.465
Hey, those guys…

49:28.548 --> 49:31.343
They trusted us
and worked themselves to the bone.

49:31.426 --> 49:32.886
I know, but--

49:32.970 --> 49:33.845
Jin-nam.

49:35.138 --> 49:37.849
Stay in the car. We'll handle this.

49:39.101 --> 49:40.227
But, sir.

49:40.310 --> 49:42.145
It'll be tough with only us two.

49:43.647 --> 49:44.731
Let's give it a try.

49:59.496 --> 50:00.330
FRONT DOOR

50:10.924 --> 50:11.967
Yes.

50:12.050 --> 50:13.552
Go on in.

50:26.440 --> 50:27.274
Let's go.

52:01.243 --> 52:02.536
Mom!

52:08.542 --> 52:09.376
Gun-woo.

52:09.459 --> 52:10.460
Woo-jin, Mom is…

52:12.045 --> 52:12.879
-Mom!
-Mom!

52:12.963 --> 52:14.965
-Hey, don't. I'll do it.
-Step aside!

52:18.802 --> 52:20.137
Damn it!

52:21.054 --> 52:22.556
Damn it!

52:22.639 --> 52:23.640
Fuck!

52:30.063 --> 52:31.523
You fucker!

52:48.081 --> 52:49.958
-Woo-jin.
-What?

52:50.041 --> 52:51.835
-I'll leave you to it.
-Huh?

52:54.588 --> 52:56.214
Gun-woo, are you okay?

53:03.555 --> 53:04.389
Whoa!

53:21.364 --> 53:22.365
Damn it!

54:14.417 --> 54:15.418
Let's go.

55:19.274 --> 55:20.275
Damn it!

56:00.482 --> 56:01.483
Are you okay?

56:02.609 --> 56:03.777
Gun-woo!

56:10.950 --> 56:12.285
Hold on.

56:15.163 --> 56:18.124
Go! Damn it, let's go!

56:20.627 --> 56:21.836
Gun-woo!

56:23.088 --> 56:24.756
Up you go. Are you okay?

56:24.839 --> 56:26.591
Mom!

56:32.639 --> 56:33.598
Easy…

56:39.979 --> 56:41.106
Let's go! Hurry!

56:44.567 --> 56:45.402
Hey!

56:46.736 --> 56:49.280
Get up! Fast!

56:53.910 --> 56:56.496
Sir, faster! Hurry!

01:00:59.489 --> 01:01:04.494
Subtitle translation by: Jooyea Lee
